      "ExternalDescriptionStr": "<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Job Title:</span> Sports Medicine Student Assistant (WS-ST2)</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Classification: </span>Student Employee (non-exempt)</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Name and Address of Employer: </span>St. Olaf College, 1520 St. Olaf Ave, Northfield, MN 55057</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">If the position requires the student to work off campus, provide the name and address here:</span></p>\n<br>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Department Name:</span> Athletic Training</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Unit Number (5 digits): </span>11727</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Length of Position: </span>See Employment Authorization<span style=\"font-weight:700\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Contact Person/Supervisor: </span>Co-Director of Sports Medicine</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Wage Range: </span>$12.00-13.00/hour</p>\n<br>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Description of the Position: (Purpose of the Position):</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt\">To support the athletic training staff in all aspects of student-athlete healthcare.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Transferable Skills:</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">Communication</p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">Human Relations</p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">Responsibility</p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">Planning</p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt\">Problem Solving</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Duties and Responsibilities:&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">Assist in opening and closing procedures for the athletic training facility</p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">Complete pre-practice or game set ups</p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">Assist in student-athlete treatments and/or rehabs</p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">Update student-athlete rehab sheets as needed</p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">Enforce athletic training facility rules to student-athletes</p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">File paperwork in the corresponding student-athlete folder</p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">Clean athletic training facility and equipment</p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">Assist in athletic competition coverage</p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">Answer phone calls and take messages</p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt\">Count and keep inventory of athletic training supplies</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Qualifications: (Education/Experience/Skills)</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">Must have and maintain CPR-First aid certification</p></li>\n <li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">\n  <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt\">Ability to maintain confidentiality</p></li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Physical and Environmental Factors:</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt\">This position requires crouching, kneeling/crawling, stooping, twisting/pivoting, reaching overhead, grasping/handling, pushing/pulling, lifting and carrying objects up to 50 lbs., repetitive motions, driving, and operating equipment/machinery to perform the essential functions. It also requires exposure to loud noise, respiratory factors, chemicals, vibrations, wet or humid conditions indoors, extreme cold, and extreme heat to perform the essential functions. Protective equipment is required for some essential functions. Candidates must possess the ability to safely perform the physical work required of all duties with or without reasonable accommodation.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">This job description is for general information purposes.&nbsp; It is not intended to list all duties and responsibilities of the position.&nbsp; This job description is subject to change at any time by St. Olaf College, with or without prior notice.</span></p>\n<div>\n <span style=\"font-weight:700\"><br></span>\n</div>",
